      "content": "i mean i have people but it doesn't really change the fact. it's more about the scale of it all. like, looking up at these massive towers and realizing i'm just a tiny, insignificant speck that doesn't matter to anyone or anything. it's not even sadness anymore, it's just this heavy realization that being here is... i don't know, optional? like the universe wouldn't even notice if i just opted out.",
